WEBVTT

00:15.140 --> 00:19.936
So it means that…
we've wasted another tank of oxygen?

00:21.021 --> 00:23.815
Two gas cars remaining,
but only one canister left.

00:24.566 --> 00:26.860
Which means that we can
never make it to the end.

00:38.955 --> 00:40.373
We're gonna die.

00:42.208 --> 00:45.670
Yeah? We are all definitely gonna die now.

00:47.839 --> 00:50.300
- I'm sorry.
- Stop being sorry. It's not your fault.

00:52.093 --> 00:54.012
I'm not blaming anyone.

00:54.596 --> 00:56.639
I know this is my own fault.

01:00.518 --> 01:01.853
But why on earth

01:01.936 --> 01:04.773
did I listen to you
and bet my life on your hunch?

01:05.440 --> 01:07.358
You're only the daughter of a liar.

01:07.442 --> 01:10.403
Ugh! I hate myself for that!

01:10.487 --> 01:12.989
Because I knew that
she was the daughter of a cheat!

01:13.073 --> 01:14.824
Calm down!

01:14.908 --> 01:15.950
Juri!

01:17.160 --> 01:18.703
Please, you have to calm down!

01:19.913 --> 01:21.915
What's the point? Huh?

01:23.166 --> 01:27.170
Why me? Why?
Tell me! Why is it I have to die now?

01:39.432 --> 01:41.810
Guys. I've got something to say.

01:44.562 --> 01:47.816
The train just passed
through Jinbōchō Station.

01:47.899 --> 01:51.444
And that means we'll soon reach
the point where the trains run parallel.

01:52.028 --> 01:53.488
And that means that,

01:53.571 --> 01:56.199
presuming the other train
is at the same speed, well, then,

01:57.617 --> 01:59.619
they'll line up side by side.

02:01.121 --> 02:03.081
What the hell are you talking about?

02:05.792 --> 02:07.836
I get it. Is that the only option left?

02:07.919 --> 02:10.004
Hmm.

02:12.799 --> 02:14.801
- You really want us to jump across?
- What?

02:14.884 --> 02:19.389
The players in that front car were
all dead. Oxygen doesn't matter.

02:19.472 --> 02:22.308
The gas has already been released.
And the doors are open.

02:22.392 --> 02:23.393
But we'll never make it!

02:23.476 --> 02:27.605
We either do nothing and die here,
or we can fight to the end!

02:27.689 --> 02:29.649
Impossible. We'll never make it!

02:31.442 --> 02:33.027
Come with me if you want to live.

03:46.017 --> 03:47.101
Count me in.

03:50.396 --> 03:52.523
Mister, are you stupid or what?

03:52.607 --> 03:55.026
Look at yourself.
How the fuck will you make it?

03:55.109 --> 03:56.194
Have you gone crazy?

04:01.491 --> 04:02.533
Timing is everything.

04:03.534 --> 04:04.953
The train is almost here!

04:10.833 --> 04:13.044
Don't worry. I know you can do it.

04:13.920 --> 04:16.422
You've got this, okay?
Believe in yourself.

04:17.590 --> 04:20.051
I got it… I got it. I can do it.

04:21.511 --> 04:23.388
- I'm with you. You can make it.
- I can do it.

04:26.975 --> 04:28.226
It's here.

04:42.991 --> 04:43.992
Get ready!

04:49.038 --> 04:50.081
Now!

04:58.047 --> 04:59.048
Move!

04:59.674 --> 05:01.926
I can do it! Here I go! Here I go!

05:03.845 --> 05:05.138
Move your ass!

05:12.395 --> 05:14.647
You died because she's a liar!

05:14.731 --> 05:15.898
Out of my way!

05:17.525 --> 05:18.568
Jump, Ryuji!

05:18.651 --> 05:19.652
Hurry up!

05:29.662 --> 05:30.913
Grab him, quick!

05:34.959 --> 05:37.795
Help me. Help me, please.

05:45.511 --> 05:46.554
You okay?

05:58.858 --> 06:00.777
There's another train approaching!

06:50.868 --> 06:51.702
Arisu!

06:51.786 --> 06:52.787
Usagi!

07:02.880 --> 07:03.965
Watch out!

07:04.048 --> 07:06.426
Usagi!

07:07.093 --> 07:08.511
Arisu!

07:09.804 --> 07:10.888
Usagi!

07:27.780 --> 07:28.906
She was with a guy.

07:28.990 --> 07:30.199
- Hey!
- Oh.

07:34.620 --> 07:36.956
The end of the line is approaching.

07:37.039 --> 07:38.708
Please stop the train.

07:38.791 --> 07:40.168
We have to stop the train!

07:40.251 --> 07:42.003
Does anyone know how to stop it?

07:42.086 --> 07:43.588
Why are you looking at me?

07:43.671 --> 07:45.131
It's the end of the line!

07:47.341 --> 07:49.260
- We have to do something, quick!
- No time!

07:49.343 --> 07:50.595
- We can't make it!
- Hang on!

07:54.932 --> 07:56.642
That's the accelerator!

07:56.726 --> 07:57.727
Then this one?

08:01.898 --> 08:03.983
It's too late! We're gonna crash!

08:39.185 --> 08:41.771
Hey! Look! What about these?

08:43.648 --> 08:45.525
Maybe… you can use them?

08:49.487 --> 08:53.449
These are support braces.
Might be useful during a game.

08:53.950 --> 08:55.409
- Thank you, Taro.
- Any time.

08:56.118 --> 08:57.370
Look! We found one!

08:57.453 --> 09:00.373
We found one!
Ryuji, look. We found you one.

09:01.916 --> 09:03.209
Awesome.

09:03.292 --> 09:05.628
- Would you like to try it?
- Sure.

09:06.546 --> 09:07.797
All together.

09:07.880 --> 09:09.215
One, two…

09:09.298 --> 09:10.925
Lift. Careful.

09:11.592 --> 09:13.427
Okay, there you go.

09:20.518 --> 09:22.186
Arisu! Hang in there. Keep going!

09:36.534 --> 09:37.618
Arisu…

09:38.119 --> 09:40.830
Tetsu, you're the only one
who can save him.

09:40.913 --> 09:41.998
Stitch him up.

09:43.374 --> 09:46.252
What are you talking about?
I've never done that before!

09:46.335 --> 09:47.670
You can do it.

09:49.630 --> 09:51.882
You stopped the bleeding and saved my leg.

09:52.383 --> 09:55.261
Look! I can almost walk now.

09:55.344 --> 09:59.223
Sure, I can stop someone from bleeding!
But this isn't the same thing at all!

10:00.766 --> 10:03.728
Okay, this was
all I could find at the store.

10:03.811 --> 10:05.146
- It's a sewing kit.
- What?

10:05.229 --> 10:08.524
- You wanna stitch him with that?
- That's it. That's all I could find.

10:08.608 --> 10:10.192
Tetsu, please try!

10:10.985 --> 10:11.902
Please, try.

10:12.570 --> 10:15.615
I also found some water
and alcohol to sterilize it.

10:17.074 --> 10:18.909
Come on! Hurry up! Hurry up!

10:18.993 --> 10:20.286
He's dying!

10:21.412 --> 10:24.123
Arisu! Arisu!

10:31.714 --> 10:32.715
- Aah!
- What the hell?

10:32.798 --> 10:34.884
That's to disinfect his wound!

10:34.967 --> 10:37.261
It stops the shakes.

12:05.266 --> 12:07.143
Why don't you get some sleep?

12:08.936 --> 12:10.479
And what about you?

12:11.689 --> 12:12.732
You were crying.

12:28.998 --> 12:30.207
I can't sleep.

12:32.918 --> 12:34.754
I keep having the same dream.

12:39.175 --> 12:41.385
Something happened that you can't forget?

12:43.929 --> 12:45.139
I was…

12:47.016 --> 12:49.059
fascinated by death for too long.

12:50.895 --> 12:52.104
And one day…

12:55.608 --> 12:58.152
I crossed a line
I should never have crossed.

12:59.820 --> 13:01.739
And there was no turning back.

13:01.822 --> 13:03.407
That's everything for today.

13:08.412 --> 13:09.955
Professor Matsuyama?

13:11.081 --> 13:13.000
I had the chance to read your paper.

13:13.083 --> 13:14.418
I found it very interesting.

13:16.337 --> 13:18.964
So, are you interested
in research about mental illness?

13:19.632 --> 13:20.508
Not really.

13:20.591 --> 13:23.719
I was more interested in the part
about stimulating the temporal lobe,

13:23.803 --> 13:26.514
and how it can reproduce
near-death experiences.

13:33.854 --> 13:39.068
Well, looks like you are the only person
in the entire university who's interested.

13:39.860 --> 13:42.780
I read in an article somewhere
that, through near-death experiences,

13:42.863 --> 13:44.698
we might get a glimpse of the afterlife.

13:45.741 --> 13:48.661
Yano, do you really believe
a land for the dead exists?

13:49.161 --> 13:51.747
I'd need to have
a tangible experience first.

13:51.831 --> 13:53.999
- Tangible?
- Yes.

13:54.083 --> 13:57.586
I hope someday you'll prove that
the land of the dead exists, Professor.

13:59.088 --> 14:01.215
I'm afraid there's
only one way to prove it.

14:01.841 --> 14:02.758
What way is that?

14:04.510 --> 14:07.096
You would have to simulate
a near-death experience.

14:16.897 --> 14:18.482
How about this?

14:20.901 --> 14:23.863
The side effects of that drug
haven't been clinically tested yet.

14:38.586 --> 14:39.712
Professor?

14:41.088 --> 14:43.215
I've made up my mind. I wanna try it.

14:45.175 --> 14:46.385
Too early.

14:49.471 --> 14:52.808
Don't you wanna discover
a world that nobody else knows?

14:53.309 --> 14:56.478
Yes, of course, but… it's too dangerous.

14:57.813 --> 15:00.858
I accept the risk. I wanna visit
the land of the dead no matter what.

15:01.692 --> 15:03.736
Professor, I'm begging you.

15:03.819 --> 15:05.070
Please let me try.

16:44.378 --> 16:45.671
Yano?

16:47.881 --> 16:48.882
Yano?

16:49.925 --> 16:50.968
Yano!

16:51.051 --> 16:51.927
Yano, wake up!

17:09.194 --> 17:10.571
A medical student has died

17:10.654 --> 17:13.157
while conducting an experiment
at Shushikan University…

17:13.240 --> 17:17.619
- The cause was a drug overdose…
- …if it was suicide or foul play.

17:17.703 --> 17:21.373
The professor in charge of the department
was suspected of assisting the suicide

17:21.457 --> 17:23.625
but has not been prosecuted
due to insufficient evidence…

17:23.709 --> 17:27.129
News is now coming in about
a serious road accident near Fuchū…

17:27.212 --> 17:30.924
The driver of the car, a man in
his thirties, was discovered unconscious…

17:31.008 --> 17:35.262
- He is in critical condition.
- …accident or attempted suicide.

17:35.345 --> 17:38.432
There's a rumor on campus
that Professor Matsuyama's car accident

17:38.515 --> 17:41.268
was a suicide attempt
after that incident with his student.

17:41.351 --> 17:43.187
I heard his heart had stopped beating.

17:43.270 --> 17:46.356
Well, I guess he finally got to
discover the land of the dead after all.

17:46.440 --> 17:48.776
That's one way of doing it!

17:58.202 --> 17:59.870
AFTERLIFE, SHARED CONSCIOUSNESS

17:59.953 --> 18:01.580
NEAR-DEATH EXPERIENCES

18:01.663 --> 18:02.915
NOT BOUND BY TIME

18:02.998 --> 18:05.709
WHEN THE SUBJECT'S HEART STOPS…

18:05.793 --> 18:09.171
…ONCE RESUSCITATED,
THEIR CONSCIOUSNESS RETURNS…

18:40.828 --> 18:43.205
I learned that once you cross that line…

18:44.873 --> 18:46.375
there's no way back.

18:57.010 --> 18:59.012
There's always a way back.

19:03.475 --> 19:06.019
Since coming back to this place,

19:06.645 --> 19:08.480
I learned something important.

19:12.609 --> 19:14.278
All of our wounds…

19:16.780 --> 19:18.657
become our reasons to live.

19:25.455 --> 19:26.748
You believe that?

19:35.215 --> 19:37.342
Let's go back to our world together.

19:57.946 --> 19:59.364
Arisu?

20:00.908 --> 20:02.367
Oh! Arisu!

20:04.828 --> 20:06.872
Thank God you're awake!

20:07.581 --> 20:08.874
I'm sorry.

20:11.793 --> 20:14.755
The new game… when does it begin?

20:17.716 --> 20:19.134
At sunset today.

20:23.263 --> 20:25.807
We're going to be late.

20:25.891 --> 20:28.685
Kid… You're not ready yet.

20:40.656 --> 20:42.157
Go ahead without me.

20:43.200 --> 20:45.285
There's no way we're leaving you here.

20:45.369 --> 20:49.164
It's true.
Arisu, we can't leave you here all alone.

20:49.248 --> 20:53.710
Twice you saved me, Arisu.
The fortunes game, and the zombie game.

20:54.836 --> 20:55.837
And me too.

20:56.338 --> 20:58.340
Well, I suppose

20:58.423 --> 21:00.259
you kinda saved me too.

21:04.429 --> 21:05.597
And me too.

21:55.981 --> 21:58.317
Attention, all players.

21:59.234 --> 22:02.112
The semifinals are about to begin.

22:03.989 --> 22:05.782
Players who survive this game

22:05.866 --> 22:09.077
will be invited
to participate in the final.

22:10.120 --> 22:13.123
Game, Tokyo Bingo Tower.

22:41.026 --> 22:42.778
Game rules.

22:42.861 --> 22:45.614
Play bingo on the Tokyo Tower.

22:46.865 --> 22:49.326
Players must climb the Tokyo Tower

22:49.409 --> 22:53.330
and press the different buzzers
installed at various points on the way.

22:53.413 --> 22:54.873
You must complete a vertical,

22:54.956 --> 22:58.126
a horizontal, or a diagonal line
on your bingo card

22:58.210 --> 23:00.212
in order to clear the game.

23:00.879 --> 23:02.631
Work together as a team.

23:02.714 --> 23:05.092
- And complete your bingo card.
- I got you.

23:05.842 --> 23:07.594
Look at me. Relax, Yuna. Calm down.

23:07.677 --> 23:09.888
Make your way up slowly.

23:09.971 --> 23:11.640
Easy. One step at a time.

23:11.723 --> 23:13.558
Let's go!

23:19.022 --> 23:22.359
Players, at the very top of the tower,
you will find a free buzzer

23:22.442 --> 23:25.529
corresponding to the free space
at the center of the bingo card.

23:25.612 --> 23:26.947
Good luck, everyone.

23:54.641 --> 23:56.810
Game, Kick the Can.

23:57.436 --> 23:59.646
Can one, start!

24:11.366 --> 24:12.742
Whoa!

24:15.412 --> 24:17.247
- Oh shit!
- Game rules.

24:17.330 --> 24:18.999
Before your time runs out,

24:19.082 --> 24:21.751
return the can
to its original starting spot

24:21.835 --> 24:23.920
and insert the can into its base.

24:24.004 --> 24:26.047
What? Whoa!

24:26.798 --> 24:27.716
Oh!

24:27.799 --> 24:31.094
- There are a total of ten cans.
- Hey, move it!

24:31.178 --> 24:34.014
So, only ten of us can
make it through the game.

24:34.097 --> 24:35.307
What?

24:36.266 --> 24:38.018
Ah…

24:44.649 --> 24:46.067
What the hell?

24:47.444 --> 24:49.362
It seems like the escalators
have been shut down.

24:49.446 --> 24:50.864
Ugh. That way!

24:55.911 --> 24:58.205
Oh, what the fuck? There's no way through.

24:58.288 --> 24:59.289
Shit!

25:00.040 --> 25:01.875
- This one's closed too!
- Let me try!

25:01.958 --> 25:03.627
Son of a bitch!

25:03.710 --> 25:04.628
Damn it!

25:04.711 --> 25:06.588
- Where is it?
- I don't see it.

25:06.671 --> 25:07.797
- There, anything?
- No.

25:07.881 --> 25:09.549
- Check in there!
- This way, come on!

25:21.186 --> 25:22.229
Oh!

25:22.312 --> 25:23.355
Gotcha!

25:23.438 --> 25:25.774
The can is also a time bomb.

25:25.857 --> 25:27.692
Safety mechanism deactivated.

25:27.776 --> 25:29.778
Gotta go! Right now!

25:29.861 --> 25:35.200
The countdown on the time bomb begins from
the moment someone is holding the can.

25:35.867 --> 25:37.077
Fuck that!

25:42.290 --> 25:45.544
The moment you release the can,
the timer resets

25:45.627 --> 25:47.379
and a new countdown begins.

25:48.463 --> 25:51.091
Damn it, I lost five seconds!

25:51.174 --> 25:56.555
Every time the owner of the can changes,
the time limit decreases by five seconds.

25:57.347 --> 25:59.474
Twenty seconds remaining.

26:00.058 --> 26:01.560
Wait up!

26:01.643 --> 26:03.937
What? No, no, no, no, no!

26:04.020 --> 26:06.106
The can will be wasted
if nobody takes it, lady!

26:06.189 --> 26:07.482
- But I can't!
- Get moving!

26:07.566 --> 26:09.359
Reset. Fifty seconds.

26:09.442 --> 26:10.819
- Run!
- This way!

26:10.902 --> 26:11.903
- Go on!
- Hey, you!

26:11.987 --> 26:13.530
- Catch her!
- We found it!

26:13.613 --> 26:15.198
- Leave me alone!
- Stop!

26:17.200 --> 26:20.579
- Leave me alone!
- Where do you think you're going?

26:20.662 --> 26:23.915
- Reset. Fifteen seconds remaining.
- Give it to me! Get outta my way!

26:28.211 --> 26:31.631
- Ten seconds remaining.
- Let go!

26:38.638 --> 26:39.681
I made it!

26:47.564 --> 26:50.066
First can. Game over.

26:50.650 --> 26:54.863
Since the can has exploded,
no player has cleared the game.

26:56.239 --> 26:57.866
Only nine cans left now.

27:00.869 --> 27:02.787
Second can. Start.

27:29.189 --> 27:30.398
Look out!

27:38.073 --> 27:41.451
In this game, we've got no chance
of winning if we go it alone.

27:42.243 --> 27:44.412
- We can relay the can between teammates.
- Natsu!

27:44.496 --> 27:46.956
- Make sure someone makes it back to base.
- Rei!

27:48.208 --> 27:50.085
- No chance!
- Gimme that can!

27:51.336 --> 27:53.129
- Natsu, take it!
- I got her!

27:53.213 --> 27:55.924
Reset. Fifty seconds remaining.

27:58.510 --> 28:00.845
- Reset. Forty-five seconds remaining.
- Run, big sis!

28:00.929 --> 28:02.472
- Outta my way!
- Run!

28:02.555 --> 28:04.474
- Get the hell off of me!
- Got it!

28:05.350 --> 28:07.852
- Nine cans left and eight of us.
- Get her!

28:07.936 --> 28:09.562
- I see her!
- Got you!

28:09.646 --> 28:11.022
Hey!

28:11.106 --> 28:12.565
Got her! Easy…

28:13.233 --> 28:15.318
- Bitch!
- Let go of it!

28:15.402 --> 28:16.903
- Gimme the damn can!
- Give it!

28:16.986 --> 28:18.613
- Shion!
- I got it! I got it!

28:18.697 --> 28:20.490
- Arisu!
- Throw it!

28:32.794 --> 28:35.922
Second can, game over.

28:36.005 --> 28:41.302
During the game, cans will explode
if they are subject to intense impact.

28:41.386 --> 28:43.304
Shit!

28:43.388 --> 28:45.557
Eight cans left.

28:48.810 --> 28:50.186
Nobu, get it!

28:52.105 --> 28:53.690
- Arisu!
- Take it!

28:53.773 --> 28:55.775
Reset.

28:55.859 --> 28:57.318
Fifty seconds remaining.

28:58.236 --> 29:00.905
Leave him alone, assholes!

29:01.656 --> 29:02.991
Arisu!

29:04.909 --> 29:06.745
They're getting away! Catch 'em! Quick!

29:07.704 --> 29:08.872
Kazuya!

29:10.039 --> 29:14.085
It's us or them, that's all!
Either they die, or we die!

29:14.586 --> 29:16.546
- Run! There's no time!
- Get him!

29:16.629 --> 29:17.922
Run!

29:18.006 --> 29:19.924
He's right! Let's go, come on!

29:20.425 --> 29:22.010
Hurry! Move it!

29:22.510 --> 29:23.887
Get out of the way!

29:27.140 --> 29:28.349
Gimme the damn can!

29:28.933 --> 29:30.685
I gotcha! I gotcha!

29:32.395 --> 29:33.772
- Give it!
- Give me the can!

29:34.481 --> 29:35.732
Sachiko! Here!

29:35.815 --> 29:37.609
Why give it to me?

29:39.110 --> 29:40.069
Reset.

29:40.153 --> 29:42.197
Twenty seconds remaining.

29:42.280 --> 29:44.324
Oh, no you don't!

29:44.407 --> 29:46.159
Lady, give it here! Pass!

29:46.701 --> 29:48.453
What the hell?

29:49.037 --> 29:51.039
- Oh, let me go!
- Stop her!

29:51.122 --> 29:52.916
- Ten seconds remaining.
- Let me go!

29:54.793 --> 29:57.128
- No! It's mine!
- Go on, Sachiko!

30:05.929 --> 30:08.348
Third can. Game cleared.

30:08.848 --> 30:10.809
Congratulations.

30:13.102 --> 30:14.521
Thank you, Tetsu.

30:16.397 --> 30:17.690
Ladies first, right?

30:18.191 --> 30:19.692
Ow!

30:23.196 --> 30:27.325
Players who clear the game are asked
to please wait in the elevator.

30:27.408 --> 30:29.202
That's one person saved.

30:43.132 --> 30:45.301
Seven cans left.

30:59.607 --> 31:00.900
Himari!

31:03.528 --> 31:05.238
Usagi! Help me!

31:05.321 --> 31:07.282
Ryuji! I'm gonna help her.

31:46.070 --> 31:48.072
Himari!

31:56.289 --> 31:59.667
You're gonna be okay.
Take my hand. You're gonna be fine.

32:16.184 --> 32:17.685
- I got you!
- Usagi!

32:21.147 --> 32:22.565
Himari!

32:39.123 --> 32:40.750
Hang on!

33:15.952 --> 33:18.371
- Are you doing okay?
- Yeah.

33:19.872 --> 33:21.290
Don't worry about me.

33:22.500 --> 33:24.252
We're gonna make it together.

33:29.841 --> 33:30.842
Leave her alone!

33:32.593 --> 33:33.469
Back off!

33:35.388 --> 33:36.389
Hey!

33:36.973 --> 33:40.018
Get your hands off her, you piece of shit!

33:40.643 --> 33:41.769
Take the can!

33:41.853 --> 33:42.937
Take it. Run!

33:44.022 --> 33:45.940
- We can clear it together!
- Reset.

33:46.024 --> 33:48.151
- Fifty seconds remaining.
- Let go of me, bitch!

33:48.234 --> 33:49.527
Fuck you, asshole!

33:57.827 --> 33:59.537
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry! Wait!

33:59.620 --> 34:02.165
Wait! I'm sorry! Let go of the can!

34:02.248 --> 34:03.750
- Please!
- Get off her!

34:03.833 --> 34:06.627
Leave her alone, you bastard!

34:06.711 --> 34:08.588
Leave me alone!

34:12.133 --> 34:13.051
Huh?

34:13.551 --> 34:14.594
- Tetsu!
- What?

34:15.094 --> 34:16.429
- Run!
- Huh?

34:16.512 --> 34:18.181
Just run! Get outta here!

34:18.264 --> 34:21.184
That can is mine, asshole!

34:28.566 --> 34:29.692
Yes!

34:30.777 --> 34:33.946
- No way! Come on! It's a fake! Fuck!
- Huh? Asshole!

34:41.996 --> 34:43.623
So, there you are!

34:44.207 --> 34:45.666
Get back here!

34:46.709 --> 34:48.044
Hand it over!

34:49.504 --> 34:51.339
Let go! Give it to me!

35:04.310 --> 35:05.603
Shion!

35:05.686 --> 35:08.189
No!

35:25.623 --> 35:26.707
Big sis?

35:27.917 --> 35:30.086
What have you done?

35:35.925 --> 35:36.968
No…

35:47.520 --> 35:48.896
What is this shit?

35:50.648 --> 35:52.525
What the fuck is going on?

35:53.818 --> 35:55.361
Tetsu, calm down.

35:55.444 --> 35:58.489
I am calm. I'm fine. I'm perfectly calm.

35:59.490 --> 36:01.492
- You have to stay positive.
- Shut up!

36:05.288 --> 36:06.622
Let's get to it.

37:18.277 --> 37:20.029
Yes!

37:34.210 --> 37:36.837
Yuna! Stop looking down.

37:37.505 --> 37:38.589
Eyes on me.

37:40.049 --> 37:42.301
I can't go on anymore! I can't!

37:43.678 --> 37:45.263
Keep going.

37:45.763 --> 37:47.974
If we don't keep going,
the balls will target us.

37:48.057 --> 37:50.893
And if we don't press the buzzers,
we can't clear the game.

37:51.394 --> 37:54.272
Yuna… grab on to the rope, okay?

37:54.897 --> 37:56.607
I've got you. You're gonna be okay.

37:56.691 --> 37:58.150
Grab it.

37:59.652 --> 38:02.613
That's it!
You're doing great! Don't look down!

38:35.521 --> 38:37.356
- Are you okay?
- Yeah!

38:44.447 --> 38:47.033
Forget about me. Just keep going.

38:47.783 --> 38:50.619
I got this. I'm gonna clear the game.

38:56.625 --> 38:58.586
Fifth can. Start.

38:58.669 --> 38:59.879
Come and try!

39:00.379 --> 39:02.506
Arisu!

39:02.590 --> 39:04.300
You bastard! Give it to me!

39:04.884 --> 39:06.260
Don't let him escape!

39:15.770 --> 39:17.313
Rei, take it! Run!

39:17.855 --> 39:19.815
Little girl! Come here!

39:22.360 --> 39:24.987
- Stay where you are!
- Rei! Go!

39:29.867 --> 39:32.328
Fifth can. Game cleared.

39:33.412 --> 39:34.747
Thank you.

39:39.168 --> 39:41.212
Sixth can. Start.

39:46.008 --> 39:47.968
Nobu, Nobu!

39:49.720 --> 39:51.097
Natsu!

39:53.265 --> 39:54.266
Tetsu!

40:07.488 --> 40:08.989
Nobu, over here!

40:10.491 --> 40:11.951
Ten seconds remaining.

40:12.034 --> 40:13.661
Give me the can!

40:13.744 --> 40:15.663
- Give it to me!
- Run! Go!

40:15.746 --> 40:17.665
Okay!

40:20.084 --> 40:23.212
Seventh can. Game cleared.

40:24.547 --> 40:25.673
I'm sorry…

40:27.133 --> 40:28.092
I'm sorry!

40:32.012 --> 40:33.597
Three cans left.

40:33.681 --> 40:35.391
And there's three of us left.

40:36.058 --> 40:37.101
Yeah.

40:38.727 --> 40:42.606
I'm gonna win this time.
I'll win for big sis.

40:46.277 --> 40:48.737
Thirty seconds remaining.

41:00.833 --> 41:03.002
Twenty seconds remaining.

41:13.721 --> 41:16.891
Reset. Thirty-five seconds remaining.

41:22.271 --> 41:25.524
Reset. Thirty seconds remaining.

41:29.153 --> 41:31.322
I'm gonna kill you!

41:36.869 --> 41:38.954
It's mine!

41:40.289 --> 41:42.917
Reset. Twenty-five seconds remaining.

41:44.793 --> 41:47.922
Reset. Twenty seconds remaining.

41:56.597 --> 41:58.933
Reset. Fifteen seconds remaining.

41:59.016 --> 42:00.434
Get the fuck off me!

42:05.856 --> 42:08.025
Reset.

42:08.108 --> 42:09.944
Ten seconds remaining.

42:10.486 --> 42:12.279
Gotcha! That can's mine!

42:12.780 --> 42:15.366
Give it to me! Let go of my can!

42:15.449 --> 42:17.535
- Let go!
- Hands off!

42:18.452 --> 42:19.662
It's mine!

42:23.541 --> 42:25.793
No!

42:28.837 --> 42:31.882
Eighth can. Game over.

42:31.966 --> 42:35.386
It can't be… Natsu…

42:37.429 --> 42:39.682
It can't be.

42:40.307 --> 42:42.601
I can't take this!

42:46.480 --> 42:48.357
They're the last two left…

43:38.657 --> 43:40.659
- One more to go.
- One more!

43:48.876 --> 43:51.879
Help me! Help me! I don't wanna die!

43:53.213 --> 43:54.465
Watch out!

43:56.133 --> 43:57.509
Taro!

44:17.488 --> 44:19.198
Hey! Gimme that!

44:23.744 --> 44:24.787
Punk!

44:27.539 --> 44:28.457
Hey!

44:28.540 --> 44:31.794
- Twenty seconds remaining.
- Go first! Take it!

44:31.877 --> 44:33.545
Arisu, leave now! Get outta here!

44:33.629 --> 44:36.924
- You broke my arm!
- I said go!

44:42.513 --> 44:45.307
- Stop him!
- Catch him!

44:52.022 --> 44:53.816
Let me go, you bastard!

44:57.027 --> 44:58.654
- Ten seconds remaining.
- Go!

44:58.737 --> 45:00.989
There's no time! Run!

45:04.910 --> 45:06.912
You can do it!

45:06.995 --> 45:07.913
Go!

45:14.586 --> 45:16.296
Ninth can. Game cleared.

45:21.343 --> 45:22.928
We're even now, kid.

45:26.390 --> 45:27.766
Don't worry about me.

45:28.684 --> 45:30.436
There's one more can left.

45:31.645 --> 45:33.021
I'll see you later.

45:33.522 --> 45:35.691
Kazuya…

47:12.788 --> 47:14.706
Safety mechanism deactivated.

47:18.001 --> 47:19.169
It's mine!

47:20.295 --> 47:22.089
No! Damn you!

47:30.180 --> 47:31.932
- Kazuya!
- Kazuya!

47:33.016 --> 47:35.060
- Run!
- Come on, you can do it!

47:35.143 --> 47:36.979
- Run! You can make it!
- Go, Kazuya!

47:37.062 --> 47:38.105
Go, Kazuya!

47:39.147 --> 47:40.607
- What?
- Kazuya!

47:42.109 --> 47:43.277
Give it!

48:03.839 --> 48:04.965
- No!
- Shit!

48:05.048 --> 48:06.842
Open the door!

48:06.925 --> 48:09.303
- Stop it!
- Kazuya!

48:12.014 --> 48:13.682
It's mine!

48:17.227 --> 48:19.271
I got it! I got it!

48:21.648 --> 48:24.234
You're going nowhere!

48:36.246 --> 48:37.623
Fuck it!

48:49.843 --> 48:51.595
Come on!

48:52.429 --> 48:54.389
Let go of it, asshole!

48:58.644 --> 49:00.020
Where you going?

49:24.795 --> 49:26.630
Ten seconds remaining.

49:38.433 --> 49:40.686
Kazuya!

50:21.351 --> 50:22.769
Bingo.

50:26.773 --> 50:29.860
CONGRATULATIONS

51:02.559 --> 51:05.187
Are you starting to enjoy this place now?

51:06.396 --> 51:09.191
I did what I promised.
I brought Usagi this far.

51:09.274 --> 51:11.234
The next game will be the last one.

51:11.735 --> 51:14.905
I'll need your help to ensure
Arisu stays here forever.

51:16.281 --> 51:18.158
All this trouble for just one man?

51:19.367 --> 51:23.080
This one man led us to clear
all the stages in the previous games.

51:23.163 --> 51:26.374
And it's thanks to him
that I've become a citizen of this world.

51:27.417 --> 51:29.878
Arisu will be perfect in this place.

51:31.963 --> 51:35.133
Who are you? What do you want?

51:40.138 --> 51:41.556
Are you the Joker?

51:46.895 --> 51:49.815
I've experienced your world.
I've memorized everything.

51:50.357 --> 51:52.943
If there's a person or an entity
that governs the land of the dead,

51:53.026 --> 51:54.152
then I wanna know about it.

51:55.237 --> 51:56.863
You're being too greedy.

51:57.531 --> 52:00.534
You should concentrate
on what I've asked you to do.

52:00.617 --> 52:02.494
Your job's not done yet.

52:08.667 --> 52:11.378
In the final game, I want you to kill her.

52:12.420 --> 52:15.006
Then, your work here will be done.

52:18.802 --> 52:21.555
If you kill that woman,
no reason to return,

52:21.638 --> 52:23.557
and he'll remain in this world.

52:25.600 --> 52:27.519
And if I do what you ask of me?

52:33.108 --> 52:37.445
If you kill Usagi,
I promise to grant your wish.

52:45.287 --> 52:48.290
I promise you will learn
about who governs the afterlife.

52:49.082 --> 52:51.751
I promise you will learn
about the land of the dead.

52:52.377 --> 52:55.046
A world beyond your wildest dreams.

52:55.755 --> 52:57.799
After that, you can do as you please.

52:58.383 --> 53:02.971
You can become a citizen of this world,
or you can return to your own world.

53:06.558 --> 53:09.394
To be honest,
I think you got a pretty good deal.

53:22.449 --> 53:24.618
You know,
you really shouldn't use this place

53:24.701 --> 53:26.870
as your own personal playground.

53:26.953 --> 53:31.082
I was happy to become a citizen here.
But all the good players are gone.

53:31.583 --> 53:35.712
I have learned that the only way to enjoy
this world is to have the best players.

53:36.504 --> 53:37.839
I have to agree.

53:38.340 --> 53:41.885
It so happens that, on my side,
there are no good players either.

53:42.385 --> 53:45.013
We're going to need
good players in this world.

53:46.431 --> 53:50.644
I hear you, but… let's be honest,
you're still enjoying yourself.

53:52.520 --> 53:54.314
Hm. Maybe.

54:14.751 --> 54:16.503
So this is it? The final game.

54:16.586 --> 54:17.587
"GAME" ARENA THIS WAY

54:21.299 --> 54:23.885
So, Shibuya is the final game arena.

54:24.719 --> 54:27.430
Let's hope that we can make it out alive.

54:28.098 --> 54:31.101
If I don't make it,
I hope you'll remember me now and then.

54:33.311 --> 54:34.771
I wouldn't count on it.

54:35.647 --> 54:36.856
Jeez, man.

54:37.649 --> 54:39.484
You better not forget about me either.

54:40.902 --> 54:43.029
You're someone no one could ever forget.

54:45.490 --> 54:49.619
If, in the end, the only way out is
betrayal, no hard feelings, okay?

54:50.704 --> 54:52.205
That's life, I guess.

54:56.126 --> 54:57.168
Ready?

55:00.880 --> 55:02.090
Let's do this.

55:23.403 --> 55:25.947
I've got a really bad
feeling about this one.

55:26.531 --> 55:27.991
Who goes first?

55:39.586 --> 55:41.129
Ladies first, madam.

55:41.212 --> 55:42.756
Age before beauty.

56:43.316 --> 56:44.275
Huh?
